Ask for at least two, and similarly some enchantment on the mail; you
won't necessarily get them, but it can't hurt.
Also, you have at most one more wish before charging, and the easiest
way to find out whether you have it or not is to just try. There's
only a 1/121 chance that you'll wrest the last charge from the wand
and lose your chance to use the ?oC. And honestly, I would use them
all (except wresting the last charge after charging) now; so much of
Nethack's challenge is in the early game now. AFAIK, blessed charging
will always bring the wand to (1:3).

